      'The overview shows per piece of equipment the approval, the documents approved out of those that apply and the software version on board; the releases waiting for approval; those approved but not yet installed; and the certificates that expire within 90 days.',
      'The equipment also appears on the page of its vessel and on the first tab of its sub-project, where + New equipment starts one that is already linked. Lists are filtered by equipment, vessel and project. Products, documents, releases (Excel) gives the workbook for the surveyor or the customer.',
      ['tip' => 'Source code and packages are not stored in the portal — only their reference and checksum, so that the copy installed on board can be verified.'],
